WHAT THE FOLD ACTUALLY DOES (runtime map) — ascii, code-grounded
=================================================================
Citations are file:line in this repo (the-fold). This is the REAL path, not the claimed one.
Written 2026-10-10. Read alongside docs/VOID-AND-FELT.md.


1. THE TURN  (#send -> answer)
==============================

  [#send / Enter]
        |  fold-chat.js:3196  composer.onsubmit -> push user msg -> run(s.id) :1849
        v
  classifyTurn(question)                                    fold-chat-discourse.js:52
        |  ^who -> "research" | advice | compute | generate | smalltalk ...
        v
  senseTerm(q)  -> bare term ("president")                   fold-chat-senses.js:31
        |  sensesProbe = web.search("wikipedia", term)       fold-chat.js:2045,2150
        v
