        |
        |- routeSources -> scopes [web,wikipedia,github,archive,openalex,crossref]
        |                                                   fold-chat-route.js:78
        |- queriesFor -> per-entity queries                 fold-chat-web.js:499
        |- ON-TOPIC GATE   applyGate  (entities/content)     fold-chat-web.js:854
        |                  titleGate  (same-name demote)     fold-chat-web.js:622
        |- READ CHAIN     readText:                          fold-chat-web.js:339
        |     direct -> bridge(/api/page) -> FOLD_RELAY/raw
        |            -> allorigins/codetabs/corsproxy/cors.eu.org/thingproxy
        |            -> r.jina.ai / microlink (text readers)
        |     looksBlocked / looksDisambiguation  (post-hoc only)
        |- impressionOf -> webPassages                       fold-chat-web.js:913
        v
  genVoid filter (generate turns only)                       fold-chat.js:2153
        v
  strand? (Sources-only)  snipsOf(webPassages)               fold-chat.js:2251
        |   if no snips -> strandEmpty=true; plan=unsourcedPlan  fold-chat.js:2253
        v
  aloneBarred = !wantWeb && !mayWriteAlone && !threadTurn     fold-chat.js:2259
        v
  callModel -> client.chat -> /heimdall/v1/chat/completions  fold-chat.js:2371
        |           (mouth = local ollama gemma2:2b, in-tab WebLLM, or fleet)
        v
  scrub: stripSelfCitations -> stripScaffolding[W#] -> checkAttributions(remove invented srcs)
        |                                                   fold-chat.js:2434..2493
        v
  REC LOOP: falsifyAnswer -> failing sentences -> re-search -> restate   fold-chat.js:2505
        v
  pivotText: read draft against material, requireGrounding   fold-chat.js:2645
        |   untraceable -> strand fallback
        v
